h everything uh  everything else that laura mentioned  with regards to sort of transferable  skills  throughout regardless so that was all  good as well and um with regards to  mentoring and coaching i have similar  process as well my the skill sets that i  want to develop were a little bit more  broad i just wanted is more so about  exposure to me and so i got really  wanted to request a deep dive into  marketing so i tried to get exposure to  the various areas even outside of the  early new product  development area so and they they did  make those happen in terms of meeting  with people and getting getting to  shadow people  so i definitely got to uh you can make  the experience what you want okay  let's go on and answer some more  questions that were submitted um in  advance by  our callers our participants uh what  adolfo is asking uh when will the  internship start and it if you applied  this year and were accepted it would  start this coming summer  and then um you would enroll at stanford  in fall of 2015.  and uh adolf was also asking what  determines the length of the internship  that's really lilly's call so we'll know  by spring if it is going to be a full  12-month fellowship  or a nine month fellowship  and what what the term is going to be  our tour asked if there's obligation to  stay  with p4d um with  the corporate sponsor after your mba and  no actually that's what's really uh  quite an advantage is you there is no  obligation to return to the same  employer  we've got a couple of people raising  their hands so  let's call on noah  um i i am currently doing an mba  application so i'm doing a regular  application but i saw the question in  the application itself  which stated whether i was applying for  the p4d fellowship or not so if you  press yes by default it just asks you to  upload certain documents i know that one  of the  requisites is the p4d essay is there any  other requirements for the application  except for the p3d fellowship essay th